      "comment": "PAW REVY (7) could manage only third at this track last time but caught the eye when posting a quick 23.95 over 425m at Bendigo three starts ago. Can measure up again if runs up to recent best times. LAURISTON GIRL (8) hit the ground running from out wide and was on speed early but swamped late when 7th at this track in a Grade 5. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Great chance to atone. ASTON FONTAINE (4) flew the lids from out wide with a slick early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (22.27) over 390m at this track. Deserves plenty of respect. PAW JELANI (3) has to be respected despite coming off a four-and-a-half months break.",
